{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/f8924f331ddcbbd6be29e31ad85c59eb.poster.avif?t=1772700021\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/f8924f331ddcbbd6be29e31ad85c59eb.webm?t=1772700021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the critical moment of humanity's survival against the threat of an alien civilization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Commander, you will become the hero to save the Federation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What!? The fleet also has super cute female crew members for you to discipline?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc96\u00a0Digi, the Jade Rabbit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dish's triumph isn't just about flavors that bring tears of joy, it's a dazzling fusion of color, aroma, and taste, a feast for both eyes and palate! Even in a cooking clash, the Fifth Regiment's grand performer, Digi, seizes every chance to leave the crowd gasping. From plating to sizzling stir-fries, every detail weaves her magical stage performances, turning the kitchen into a thrilling spectacle. She's not just here to win your taste buds... She's after your heart and soul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/4cde08baa7d0d86284eb7226f45cabd3.avif?t=1772700021\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc96\u00a0Allee Winter, the Lustrous Gold Shark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it comes to cooking, Allee stays true to her usual precision and powerhouse flair. Her signature spicy chili oil, the rising steam and rich aroma swirling as she stirs the pan with practiced ease... one can no longer tell whether the enticing scent comes from the dish, or Allee herself. Every element, from the bold seasoning to the astonishing flavors, is a result of her calculated perfection. That said, the kitchen is often left in utter chaos, and many brave taste testers can't help but grimace at the first bite...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/8091cde83f9198991d11072981d24eeb.avif?t=1772700021\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Mimic Beauty \u00d7 Cross-Species</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth girls no longer satisfy you? Now explore outer space for more intelligent female lifeforms!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jellyfish-like girls, octopus-like girls, and various stunning mimic girls await, offering ultimate pleasure for you to experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/ac2d0ab1518e3b97f8f2738f0ebd67d4.poster.avif?t=1772700021\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/ac2d0ab1518e3b97f8f2738f0ebd67d4.webm?t=1772700021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Bullet Hell \u00d7 Strategic Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exhilarating STG bullet hell shooting gameplay paired with a customizable weapon system!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip diverse weapons, armor, and chips based on enemy traits to create the ultimate personalized mech and break through relentless bullet ba